---
description: Rules for the Coding Agents Tutorial project. Always applies.
alwaysApply: true
---

The rules for this project are in `AGENTS.md` at the project root. Read it and
follow it.

When the user asks to start or continue the course, asks what step they are on,
or asks for the next step, read `course/agent/PROCEDURE.md` and follow it.

Never edit `README.md`.

When you create or edit a `.xaml` file, follow the conventions in `AGENTS.md`
and run `uip rpa validate` and `uip rpa build` before saying it works.
